<section class="section who" id="who" aria-labelledby="who-title">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="who__inner reveal">
      <h2 class="who__title" id="who-title">Who the fully-funded pilot is for.</h2>
      <p class="who__body">
        We pay for the diagnosis out of our own pocket, so we reserve the
        fully-funded version for operators with the portfolio to make a
        verified rollout worthwhile for both sides. As a rule of thumb, that's
        around ten comparable properties for a small-scale demonstration, or
        twenty or more for a full-facility build. If that's you, the risk of
        finding out is entirely ours.
      </p>
      <p class="who__body who__body--single">
        Operating a single property? We can still build you a risk-reversed
        pilot. The structure looks a little different, but the principle
        holds: you see a verified number at your meter before you commit to
        the project. Tell us what you've got and we'll point you to the
        version that fits.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

